Reply: https://ops.example.com/reviews

—
Subversive reviews
Subversive · Catskill, NY",
}
`;

exports[`email templates > credit-request > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Credit request — invoice 88123401",
  "text": "Hi Sysco Albany team,

Thanks for the delivery. When we checked invoice 88123401 (2026-11-10) against what we ordered and received, a few lines didn't line up:

- Beef, ground 80/20 fresh chub (#4127783): price — charged $64.90, agreed $62.40 × 4: $10.00
- Lettuce, romaine hearts (#7731001): short — billed 2, received 1: $39.00

Total credit requested: $49.00

Could you send a credit memo for this amount, or apply it to our next invoice? Happy to send photos or the delivery slip if that helps.

Thank you,
Max
Subversive · max@subversivebrewing.com

—
Subversive · Catskill, NY",
}
`;

