  "subject": "Week of Nov 16: 3 things need you",
  "text": "Hi Max,

Week of Nov 16 – Nov 22. We're forecasting $24,850 in sales (above the $24,000 target), busiest on Friday and Saturday. Labor is scheduled at 27% of forecast vs 28% target. On the calendar: Holiday market (Sat, Nov 21).

LAST WEEK (Nov 2 – Nov 8)
- Sales: $24,180 (target $25,000)
- Food cost: 29.4% (target 30.0%)
- Beverage cost: 23.1% (target 22.0%)
- Labor: 31.8% (target 29.0%)
- Prime cost: 58.6% (target 59.0%)

NEEDS YOU
- Order from Sysco Albany: 14 items · $1,284.50 · delivers Tue, Nov 17 (https://ops.example.com/ordering)
- Publish the schedule: 18 draft shifts · 212 h · labor 27% of forecast (https://ops.example.com/schedule)
- Price increases this week: 3 items went up in the last 7 days (https://ops.example.com/prices)

IN HAND
- Staff requests: Nothing waiting
- Counts: Last count Nov 9

Full brief: https://ops.example.com/brief

—
Subversive weekly brief
Subversive · Catskill, NY",
